  * "isGEQ(AbstractPoint,AbstractPoint)" -- see *note isGEQ: isGEQ, -- compare
    two points
  * "isRealPoint(AbstractPoint)" -- see *note isRealPoint: isRealPoint, --
    determine whether a point is real
  * *note norm(Thing,AbstractPoint): norm_lpThing_cmAbstractPoint_rp, -- p-norm
    of the point
  * "point(AbstractPoint)" -- see *note point: point, -- construct a Point
  * *note project(AbstractPoint,ZZ): project_lpAbstractPoint_cmZZ_rp, --
