DualSpace -- a dual functional vector subspace
**********************************************

Description
===========

This type stores a finite dimensional subspace of the local dual of a
polynomial ring at a point. In practice, the subspace is stored as a *note
PolySpace: PolySpace, with functionals represented by the corresponding
polynomial, along with a *note AbstractPoint: AbstractPoint,. The following
methods can be used to access a DualSpace:

  * gens -- a one-row matrix of the generators
  * dim -- the number of generators
  * ring -- the ring of the generators
  * point -- the base point of the dual space

See also
========

  * *note dualSpace: dualSpace, -- construct a DualSpace
  * *note PolySpace: PolySpace, -- a polynomial vector subspace

