      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, k linear combinations of
        polynomials in F (of generators of I)

Description
===========

A variety V (that is not necessarily a complete intersection) of codimension k
is a component of a complete intersection of codimension k defined by k general
linear combinations of any generating set of the defining ideal of V.

This function automates the above construction.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = CC[x,y,z];                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = {x*y, x^2 - y, x*z};                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : L = generalEquations(2,F)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|                            2                                                |
|o3 = {(.29398 + .632944*ii)x  + (.892712 + .673395*ii)x*y + (.0258884 +      |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                       2     |
|     .714827*ii)x*z + (- .29398 - .632944*ii)y, (.461944 + .775187*ii)x  +   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (.89189 + .231053*ii)x*y + (.909047 + .314897*ii)x*z + (- .461944 -     |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     .775187*ii)y}                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

