|                                                      |
|o3 : PolySystem                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : ring T                                           |
|                                                      |
|o4 = CC  [x..y, t]                                    |
|       53                                             |
|                                                      |
|o4 : PolynomialRing                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------+

