NumericalVariety -- a numerical variety
***************************************

Description
===========

This type stores a collection of witness sets representing a complex affine
variety.

Note that
  * The ambient space is expected to be the same, i.e., *note dimension:
    WitnessSet, (or *note ProjectionDimension: WitnessSet,) of *note witness
    sets: WitnessSet, should be the same.
  * The constructor *note numericalVariety(List): numericalVariety_lpList_rp,
    does not check the sensibility of the input; run *note
    check(NumericalVariety): NumericalVariety, to verify the validity of a
    numerical variety.
Basic service routines:
  * dim -- the dimension
  * codim -- the codimension
  * deg -- the degree
  * *note components(NumericalVariety): components_lpNumericalVariety_rp,
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = CC[x,y]; I = ideal((x^2+y^2+2)*x,(x^2+y^2+2)*y*(y-1));              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : w1 := witnessSet(I , ideal(x-y), {point {{0.999*ii,0.999*ii}}, point    |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = [dim=1,deg=2]-*may be reducible*-                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : WitnessSet                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{{-1.001*ii,-1.001*ii}}} )                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : w0 := witnessSet(I, ideal R, {point {{0.,0.}}})                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = [dim=0,deg=1]-*may be reducible*-                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : WitnessSet                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : w0' := witnessSet(I, ideal R, {point {{0.,1.}}})                        |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = [dim=0,deg=1]-*may be reducible*-                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : WitnessSet                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : V := numericalVariety {w0,w1,w0'}                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = a "numerical variety" with components in                                |
|     dim 0:  [dim=0,deg=1]-*may be reducible*- [dim=0,deg=1]-*may be         |
|     dim 1:  [dim=1,deg=2]-*may be reducible*-                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : NumericalVariety                                                        |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|reducible*-                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : dim V                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : degree V                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 2                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note WitnessSet: WitnessSet, -- a witness set

