    evaluate, -- evaluate a polynomial system or matrix at a point
  * *note homogenize(PolySystem,Ring,RingElement):
    homogenize_lpPolySystem_cmRing_cmRingElement_rp, -- homogenize a polynomial
    system
  * "equations(PolySystem)"
  * "ideal(PolySystem)"
  * "isHomogeneous(PolySystem)"
  * "jacobian(PolySystem)"
  * "net(PolySystem)"
  * "numFunctions(PolySystem)"
  * "numParameters(PolySystem)"
  * "numVariables(PolySystem)"
  * "parameters(PolySystem)"
  * "ring(PolySystem)"
  * "polySystem(PolySystem)" -- see *note polySystem: polySystem, -- construct
    a polynomial system
  * *note substitute(PolySystem,Ring): substitute_lpPolySystem_cmRing_rp, --
    substitute a ring in a polynomial system
  * "witnessSet(PolySystem,Matrix,List)" -- see *note witnessSet: witnessSet,
    -- construct a WitnessSet
