substitute(PolySystem,Ring) -- substitute a ring in a polynomial system
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note substitute: (Macaulay2Doc)substitute,
  * Usage: 
        G = sub(F,R)
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note polynomial system: PolySystem,
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,
  * Outputs:
      * G, a *note polynomial system: PolySystem,

Description
===========

Constructs a *note polynomial system: PolySystem, by attempting to map
polynomials of a given system to a given ring.

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y]; S := polySystem {x^2+y^2-6, 2*x^2-y}|
|                                                      |
|o2 = {-2} | x2+y2-6 |                                 |
|     {-2} | 2x2-y   |                                 |
|                                                      |
|o2 : PolySystem                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T := sub(S,CC[x,y])                              |
|                                                      |
|o3 = {-2} | x2+y2-6 |                                 |
|     {-2} | 2x2-y   |                                 |
|                                                      |
|o3 : PolySystem                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : ring T                                           |
|                                                      |
|o4 = CC  [x..y]                                       |
|       53                                             |
|                                                      |
|o4 : PolynomialRing                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note polySystem: polySystem, -- construct a polynomial system
  * *note PolySystem: PolySystem, -- a polynomial system

